# No merge before CI

Never merge a pull request while checks are queued, pending, skipped-as-pending, or failed.

```bash
# wait until every required check finished
gh pr checks --watch
# merge only after gh pr checks shows all required jobs pass
gh pr view --json mergeStateStatus,statusCheckRollup
```

- Do not run `gh pr merge` when `mergeStateStatus` is `UNSTABLE`, `BLOCKED`, or checks are `QUEUED` / `IN_PROGRESS`.
- Do not use `--admin` or any bypass to skip a running or failed pipeline.
- If the user asks to ship, open the PR, watch CI, fix failures, then merge.
